<title>HONG KONG: Great China interim net up 1.37 percent.</title>
<headline>Great China interim net up 1.37 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.92	vs 3.87</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.60	vs 1.60</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  7.04 loss vs 0.45 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    10.26     vs 10.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		     303.58    vs 49.75</p>
<p>    Company name		 Great China Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 15-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Great China is a holding company with interests in property, footwear manufacturing and garment distribution.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$8.05 million on provision for disposal of long term investment and gain of HK$1.01 million on compensation received.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
